00:07:46.332 --> 00:07:47.400
just as it turned out.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.102
Happened on the 11th floor, I believe.

00:07:50.303 --> 00:07:51.337
So we were

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:54.807
drastically far removed from it.

00:07:54.807 --> 00:07:56.008
That's good.

00:07:56.242 --> 00:07:58.110
And what kind of resources

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:00.313
