00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:08.654
Yeah.

00:08:08.654 --> 00:08:09.121
I imagine

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:10.256
that'll become more clear

00:08:10.256 --> 00:08:11.524
over the next day. Or two.

00:08:11.524 --> 00:08:13.192
The first step is basically trying

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:14.627
to return the hospital

00:08:14.627 --> 00:08:16.562
