00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.806
So patient care trumps everything.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.841
And then following that,

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:30.443
I know the hospital will be working

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:32.044
with any staff in there,

00:08:32.044 --> 00:08:34.313
you know, understandable to stress.

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:37.316
And what goes through your mind, Doctor,

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:38.985
thinking about,

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:40.753
you know, the awful situation

00:08:40.753 --> 00:08:43.356
that so many families find themselves in

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.425
where a loved one is terminally ill,

00:08:46.425 --> 00:08:48.661
going through a very difficult

