Yeah.

00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:57.436
You know, I've come to my job.

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.906
I think people on stage are still here.

00:08:59.906 --> 00:09:02.608
You know, on a very routine basis.

00:09:03.309 --> 00:09:03.743
To me,

00:09:03.743 --> 00:09:04.243
it seems like

00:09:04.243 --> 00:09:06.279
there are so many options out there.

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:06.846
You know,

00:09:06.846 --> 00:09:08.714
hospital is an amazing resource

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:09.415
to patients

00:09:09.415 --> 00:09:11.450
who are terminally ill where they can,

00:09:12.118 --> 00:09:14.954
you know, be pain free and anxiety free.

00:09:15.288 --> 00:09:16.222
And it's really,

00:09:16.222 --> 00:09:18.157
you know, a great program.

00:09:18.157 --> 00:09:19.659
I don't know how someone can

00:09:19.659 --> 00:09:21.294
get to the desperate

00:09:21.294 --> 00:09:22.228
desperation level

00:09:22.228 --> 00:09:24.196
to take on such an extreme measure.

00:09:24.196 --> 00:09:26.198
But there really are resources out there.

